  "body": "VIEWING BY APPOINTMENT\r\n\r\nThis modern Mission Bay north-facing garden apartment enjoys the luxury of a 69 sqm sun-drenched private courtyard. This thoughtful layout offers two double bedrooms, two bathrooms (master with ensuite), a lovely open-plan modern kitchen with Miele appliances. The open plan dining area and lounge room enjoys a 2.7m stud height plus an extra multi-room is perfect for an office or tv snug.  Floor-to-ceiling glass lets the outdoor garden courtyard into the apartment and you are facing due north.  Concrete construction cushions you from any noise and you are safe and secure with lift access from the car park to your front door.  Simply walk across the road to enjoy the Eastridge shopping precinct and head down the hill to the cafes and restaurants at Mission Bay Beach.   Enjoy this relaxed lifestyle and let others take care of the day to day maintenance of your home.  This apartment is perfect for those who travel away over the winter yet love to entertain family and friends when you are at home. \r\nAUCTION Thursday 1st October 11am (unless sold prior)\r\n*  Stratum in Freehold\r\n* Council Rates: $5,708.68 p/a (25/26)\r\n* CV: $1,925,000\r\n* BC Levies: $11,716.98 p/a\r\n* Schools: Selwyn College and St Thomas School (Auckland)\r\n* Residential - Terrace Housing and Apartment Building Zone\r\n* Rental Appraisal: $900 - $1000 per week\r\nPlease call JAYNE 021 352 007 or AMY 0274 820 100\r\nConjunctions are welcome.",
